  "description": "Following the advice of his imaginary friend Jason, who told him, \"Treat all girls like stones,\" Park Jin-yong starts seeing every girl as a stone. But then Sunwoo, a female student who doesn’t look like a stone, appears before him, and for the first time in five years, the sight of a girl’s face sends Jinyong’s happy little circuits into overdrive...\n\n*Source: Naver, translated*",
